WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:05.171
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.255 --> 00:06.923
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.006 --> 00:08.842
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.925 --> 00:11.803
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.886 --> 00:13.805
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.888 --> 00:16.099
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:16.182 --> 00:17.851
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.934 --> 00:20.228
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.311 --> 00:22.188
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:22.272 --> 00:24.274
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.357 --> 00:26.317
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.401 --> 00:27.694
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.777 --> 00:29.529
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.197
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.281 --> 00:32.615
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.699 --> 00:34.701
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.784 --> 00:37.328
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:54.846 --> 00:59.225
SpongeBob: Seven, six, five,
four, three, two...
海绵宝宝：七、六、五、
四、三、二……

00:59.309 --> 01:00.560
whoa-Oh!
哇哦！

01:00.643 --> 01:03.104
Open for business.
开门营业。

01:03.188 --> 01:05.064
Yeah, whoo.
是的，呼。

01:05.148 --> 01:06.649
Oh, Mr. Krabs, Mr. Krabs,
can I do it today?
哦，蟹老板，蟹老板，
我今天可以做吗？

01:06.733 --> 01:08.818
Uuh-huh, can I, can I do it?
呃呃，我可以吗，我可以吗？

01:08.902 --> 01:10.737
I suppose you can
have the honor today, lad.
我想你可以
今天很荣幸，小伙子。

01:12.280 --> 01:13.948
Whoo.
呼。

01:14.032 --> 01:15.408
37, 38 --
37, 38——
37, 38——
37、38——
37, 38——
37、38——
37、38——
37、38——

01:22.415 --> 01:23.958
Freshness, check.
新鲜度，检查一下。

01:24.042 --> 01:26.544
Buns, check.
包子，检查一下。

01:26.628 --> 01:28.046
Fresh patties...
新鲜的肉饼...

01:34.052 --> 01:35.512
Check.
查看。

01:35.595 --> 01:37.514
Oh, silly me.
哦，愚蠢的我。

01:37.597 --> 01:38.848
I'm forgetting
one more minor detail.
我忘记了
还有一个小细节。

01:40.099 --> 01:41.726
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

01:41.810 --> 01:43.269
Is it getting hot in here?
这里变热了吗？

01:43.353 --> 01:44.646
Or is it just you?
或者只是你？

01:44.729 --> 01:46.481
Ah.
啊。

01:48.274 --> 01:50.443
"Two Krabby Patties.
“两个蟹肉饼。

01:50.527 --> 01:52.946
P.S. SpongeBob, you're an idiot.
附：海绵宝宝，你是个白痴。

01:53.029 --> 01:54.781
Love, Squidward."
爱你，章鱼哥。”

01:54.864 --> 01:57.325
Oh, love you too, Squiddy.
哦，我也爱你，鱿鱼。

01:57.408 --> 01:59.369
Two Krabby Patties
comin' right up.
两块蟹肉饼
马上就来了。

01:59.452 --> 02:01.329
Whoa.
哇哦。

02:03.540 --> 02:04.916
Hmm...
唔...

02:08.545 --> 02:09.921
Got ya.
明白了。

02:21.558 --> 02:23.893
Hoo, this thing
is stuck pretty good.
呼，这个东西
卡得很好。

02:31.693 --> 02:33.027
I guess this is it.
我想就是这样了。

02:40.243 --> 02:43.037
Oh, you really saved me.
噢，你真的救了我。

02:52.297 --> 02:54.340
Hey, a splinter.
嘿，一个碎片。

02:54.424 --> 02:58.469
Ok, well it's been nice knowing
ya, but you've got to go... Now.
好的，很高兴知道
是的，但你必须走……现在。

02:58.553 --> 03:00.680
OK, out we go.
好的，我们出发吧。

03:00.763 --> 03:02.724
Whoa, that kind of hurts.
哇，那种感觉很痛。

03:02.807 --> 03:04.350
Come on,  ,
whoa, that really hurts.
来吧，，
哇，真的很痛。

03:04.434 --> 03:06.686
Oh, barnacles, this hurts.
哦，藤壶，这很疼。

03:08.771 --> 03:12.191
Conch-shelled manatees,
this is painful!
海螺壳海牛，
这很痛苦！

03:19.324 --> 03:22.660
OK, you're tough, you're smart
and you are charming.
好吧，你很坚强，你很聪明
你很迷人。

03:22.744 --> 03:24.537
But you are
still no match for me.
但你是
还是不敌我。

03:24.621 --> 03:26.497
Look, a bald eagle
with a moustache.
看，一只秃鹰
留着小胡子。

03:30.627 --> 03:32.712
OK, fine, stay.
好吧，好吧，留下来。

03:32.795 --> 03:35.298
But I hope you like
making Krabby Patties.
但我希望你喜欢
制作蟹黄饼。

03:35.381 --> 03:37.675
Excuse me, sir, but, um...
对不起，先生，但是，嗯...

03:37.759 --> 03:39.886
I ordered a couple
Krabby Patties a while ago
我订了一对
不久前的蟹肉饼

03:39.969 --> 03:41.554
and, uh, I'm wondering
when they'll be out.
而且，呃，我想知道
他们什么时候出来。

03:45.433 --> 03:48.311
Looks like I'm crushing
your face.
看来我要崩溃了
你的脸。

03:48.394 --> 03:50.897
So will they be ready soon?
那么他们很快就会准备好吗？

03:50.980 --> 03:52.106
Yeah-yeah-yeah, don't move
too much, it ruins it.
是啊是啊，别动
太多了，就会毁了它。

03:56.069 --> 03:58.237
Ow, ow, ow.
噢，噢，噢。

03:58.321 --> 03:59.989
You're making this
a little bit difficult.
你正在做这个
有点困难。

04:00.073 --> 04:02.241
Luckily, I am ambidextrous.
幸运的是，我双手灵巧。

04:13.503 --> 04:15.213
Perfection.
完美。

04:20.301 --> 04:22.303
I hear you, I hear you.
我听到你的声音，我听到你的声音。

04:22.387 --> 04:25.348
Ok, good, 'cause these two
Krabby Patties are ready.
好吧，很好，因为这两个人
蟹黄饼就准备好了。

04:26.808 --> 04:28.601
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

04:28.685 --> 04:30.144
Yes?
是的？

04:30.228 --> 04:31.229
Can I ask you something?
我能问你一件事吗？

04:31.312 --> 04:32.438
Yes.
是的。

04:32.522 --> 04:33.606
What's that?
那是什么？

04:33.690 --> 04:34.941
What's what?
什么是什么？

04:35.024 --> 04:37.110
You know.
你知道。

04:37.193 --> 04:38.611
Know what?
知道什么吗？

04:38.695 --> 04:40.029
This.
这。

04:40.113 --> 04:41.531
This thing here.
这东西在这里。

04:41.614 --> 04:42.991
What thing where?
什么东西在哪里？

04:43.074 --> 04:45.618
The spatula  tied to your nose!
抹刀绑在你的鼻子上！

04:45.702 --> 04:48.788
This.
这。

04:48.871 --> 04:50.957
Well, you see,
this got stuck up there.
嗯，你看，
这被卡在那里了。

04:51.040 --> 04:53.126
So I stacked stuff
and I climbed up to reach it.
所以我把东西堆起来
我爬上去到达了那里。

04:53.209 --> 04:54.627
I reached to grab it,
I got it, but then I fell
我伸手去抓它，
我明白了，但后来我跌倒了

04:54.711 --> 04:56.629
and I screamed!
我尖叫起来！

04:56.713 --> 04:58.965
I was sure I was dead,
but then I wasn't.
我确信我已经死了
但后来我就不是了。

04:59.048 --> 05:01.009
But then I tripped and I got
this splinter, uh, Squidward?
但后来我绊倒了
这块碎片，呃，章鱼哥？

05:01.092 --> 05:03.052
Squidward, were you
listening at all?
章鱼哥，你是
到底在听吗？

05:03.136 --> 05:05.388
I got this really bad
splinter, you see?
我真的很糟糕
碎片，你看到了吗？

05:05.471 --> 05:06.973
And I couldn't hold the spatula
with my hand, so I used my nose.
我拿不住抹刀
用手，所以我用鼻子。

05:07.056 --> 05:08.850
Makes sense now, right?
现在有道理了，对吧？

05:08.933 --> 05:11.144
Oh, yeah, that
makes perfect sense.
哦，是的，那个
很有道理。

05:11.227 --> 05:12.979
You're a halfwit who injured
himself at work being a nitwit.
你是个受伤的傻瓜
他自己在工作中就是个白痴。

05:13.062 --> 05:15.064
Good one, Squiddy.
好一个，乌贼。

05:15.148 --> 05:19.068
D'oh, injury,
your brain is injured.
哎呀，受伤了，
你的大脑受伤了。

05:19.152 --> 05:21.112
Wait a minute.
等一下。

05:21.195 --> 05:24.449
Did you say you got that
splinter injury at work?
你说你明白了吗
工作中受到碎片伤害？

05:24.532 --> 05:26.159
Yeah.
是的。

05:26.242 --> 05:27.827
Oh,  ,
that's not good.
哦，，
那不好。

05:27.910 --> 05:29.829
I know, it hurts so bad.
我知道，这太痛了。

05:29.912 --> 05:32.665
Yeah, when Mr. Krabs
finds out, oh, man.
是的，当蟹老板
发现，哦，伙计。

05:32.749 --> 05:34.042
Finds out what?
发现了什么？

05:34.125 --> 05:35.668
Finds out about this injury.
了解了这次受伤的情况。

05:35.752 --> 05:37.503
You mean my splinter?
你是说我的碎片吗？

05:37.587 --> 05:39.672
He'll be forced to
send you home.
他将被迫
送你回家。

05:39.756 --> 05:41.424
H-H-H-Home, but I'm fine.
回家了，但我很好。

05:41.507 --> 05:43.259
Here, let me take this for you.
在这里，让我替你拿这个。

05:43.342 --> 05:44.635
Why?
为什么？

05:44.719 --> 05:46.346
Hey, wait, I'm fine.
嘿，等等，我很好。

05:46.429 --> 05:48.264
It was a good shift
while it lasted.
这是一个很好的转变
当它持续的时候。

05:48.347 --> 05:49.849
While it lasted,
what are you doing?
当它持续的时候，
你在做什么？

05:49.932 --> 05:53.019
W-W-W-What are you?
W-W-W-你是什么？

05:53.102 --> 05:55.521
I know it's hard
to say good-Bye.
我知道这很难
说再见。

05:55.605 --> 05:57.523
But, but Squidward, I'm fine.
但是，但是章鱼哥，我很好。

05:57.607 --> 05:59.067
♪ I'm fine, I'm ok ♪
♪ 我很好，我很好 ♪

05:59.150 --> 06:00.651
♪ Look at me, nothing's wrong ♪
♪ 看看我，没什么问题 ♪

06:00.735 --> 06:02.904
See, see, see, see?
看，看，看，看？

06:02.987 --> 06:05.323
Oh, I believe you, SpongeBob.
哦，我相信你，海绵宝宝。

06:05.406 --> 06:09.368
But unfortunately,
the rules clearly state
that you must be sent home.
但不幸的是，
规则明确规定
你必须被送回家。

06:09.452 --> 06:11.245
No, anything but that.
不，除此之外什么都没有。

06:11.329 --> 06:13.372
Please, Squidward,
you can't let this happen.
求你了，章鱼哥，
你不能让这种事发生。

06:13.456 --> 06:16.084
You can't let them
force me away.
你不能让他们
强行把我赶走。

06:16.167 --> 06:18.544
Sorry, the rules are the rules.
抱歉，规则就是规则。

06:21.214 --> 06:24.217
Yeah, it'll be
pretty quiet around here
是的，将会是
这里很安静

06:24.300 --> 06:26.886
with Mr. Krabs sending you
home early and all.
蟹老板送你去
早点回家。

06:26.969 --> 06:32.725
I just hope we'll make it
through the whole rest of
this day without you here.
我只是希望我们能成功
通过整个其余的
没有你的这一天。

06:38.439 --> 06:39.857
Please, Squidward.
求你了，章鱼哥。

06:39.941 --> 06:44.070
Don't tell Mr. Krabs.
别告诉蟹老板先生。

06:44.153 --> 06:46.739
What, me tell Mr. Krabs?
什么，我告诉蟹老板？

06:46.823 --> 06:48.574
Oh, no...
哦，不...

06:48.658 --> 06:50.326
No, no, no, no-no-no-no.
不，不，不，不不不不。

06:50.409 --> 06:52.495
No, no, no, no, no.
不，不，不，不，不。

06:52.578 --> 06:54.205
No, no, no-no-no-no.
不，不，不不不不。

06:54.288 --> 06:55.331
No.
不。

06:55.414 --> 06:57.250
Whew.
呼。

06:57.333 --> 06:58.584
Well, maybe.
嗯，也许吧。

07:00.211 --> 07:03.256
I don't have to tell Mr. Krabs.
我不必告诉蟹老板。

07:03.339 --> 07:05.842
Because
he already knows.
因为
他已经知道了。

07:18.563 --> 07:20.314
He does?
他有吗？

07:20.398 --> 07:22.692
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

07:22.775 --> 07:26.487
Krabs has preternatural
instincts when it comes to
situations like this.
螃蟹有超自然的能力
当涉及到时的本能
像这样的情况。

07:26.571 --> 07:31.159
It's almost as if
when something's amiss
in his restaurant...
几乎就像
当出现问题时
在他的餐厅里...

07:31.242 --> 07:33.452
He can smell it.
他能闻到。

07:45.089 --> 07:47.758
These quarters smell sad.
这些宿舍闻起来很悲伤。

07:47.842 --> 07:52.221
You're not planning on getting
a refill with 'em, are you?
你不打算得到
补充一下，是吗？

07:52.305 --> 07:53.472
No, I wasn't.
不，我不是。

07:57.894 --> 07:59.854
You're right, Squidward,
I need help.
你说得对，章鱼哥，
我需要帮助。

08:03.441 --> 08:05.484
Please pick up, please pick up,
please pick up.
请接机，请接机，
请接。

08:09.864 --> 08:10.907
Patrick?
帕特里克？

08:10.990 --> 08:12.575
Yeah?
是的？

08:12.658 --> 08:14.327
Ah, thank goodness you're there.
啊，谢天谢地你在那儿。

08:14.410 --> 08:15.786
I got a splinter
in my thumb and...
我有一个碎片
在我的拇指和...

08:15.870 --> 08:17.288
Mm-hmm, I see.
嗯嗯，我明白了。

08:17.371 --> 08:18.956
Well, I'm pretty booked today.
嗯，今天我的预约已经满了。

08:19.040 --> 08:20.833
But I think I can fit you in.
但我想我可以适应你。

08:20.917 --> 08:22.001
Thanks, Patrick.
谢谢，帕特里克。

08:22.084 --> 08:23.211
No problem.
没问题。

08:27.381 --> 08:32.220
You called the right person,
Mr. SpongeBob.
你给对的人打电话了，
海绵宝宝先生。

08:32.303 --> 08:34.972
Now let's see where
the problem's at.
现在让我们看看在哪里
问题出在。

08:35.056 --> 08:38.392
Hmm, interesting.
嗯，有趣。

08:39.727 --> 08:41.270
Uh, Patrick?
呃，帕特里克？

08:43.940 --> 08:46.817
Hmm, interesting.
嗯，有趣。

08:46.901 --> 08:48.194
Patrick...
帕特里克...

08:53.783 --> 08:55.826
Patrick, this isn't helping.
帕特里克，这没有帮助。

08:55.910 --> 08:59.538
Oh, I'm sorry.
哦，对不起。

08:59.622 --> 09:02.208
I didn't realize
you were a doctor, humph.
我没有意识到
你是一名医生，哼。

09:02.291 --> 09:04.543
I'm not.
我不是。

09:04.627 --> 09:07.213
Oh, but I'm sure you can
figure it out with your
12 years of med school.
哦，但我相信你可以
和你一起弄清楚
12年医学院学习经历。

09:07.296 --> 09:08.631
Patrick, you didn't
go to med school.
帕特里克，你没有
去医学院。

09:08.714 --> 09:10.383
So?
所以？

09:10.466 --> 09:12.677
Patrick, I'm sorry,
I really need your help.
帕特里克，对不起，
我真的需要你的帮助。

09:12.760 --> 09:15.054
Oh, no, no, it looks like
you have things under control.
噢不不，看起来像
你一切尽在掌控之中。

09:15.137 --> 09:17.807
Please, Patrick,
I don't want to go home early.
拜托，帕特里克，
我不想早点回家。

09:20.351 --> 09:24.605
OK, but we play by
my rules, "SquareBob."
好吧，但我们玩的是
我的规则是“SquareBob”。

09:26.565 --> 09:29.151
Well, here's your problem.
好吧，这就是你的问题。

09:29.235 --> 09:30.820
But don't you worry, buddy.
但别担心，伙计。

09:30.903 --> 09:33.072
We're gonna make it go away.
我们要让它消失。

09:33.155 --> 09:34.573
Ah, thanks, Patrick,
you're a lifesaver.
啊，谢谢，帕特里克，
你是救星。

09:42.415 --> 09:43.249
Ow.
噢。

09:46.377 --> 09:48.546
There appears to be
a little bit of swelling.
似乎有
有点肿胀。

09:50.506 --> 09:54.176
This garbage compress
should help that go down.
这个垃圾压缩
应该有助于下降。

09:58.055 --> 10:00.766
That doesn't look good.
那看起来不太好。

10:02.268 --> 10:03.102
Yeah, but my shift is over.
是的，但我的轮班已经结束了。

10:04.854 --> 10:06.272
Call me in the morning...
早上给我打电话...

10:06.355 --> 10:07.606
If you can still dial a phone.
如果还能拨打电话的话。

10:12.862 --> 10:14.030
What's that?
那是什么？

10:14.113 --> 10:15.531
What's what?
什么是什么？

10:15.615 --> 10:16.782
Behind your back.
在你背后。

10:16.866 --> 10:18.659
You mean... This?
你是说……这个？

10:18.743 --> 10:20.369
Put your hat on, boy,
show some company pride.
戴上你的帽子，孩子，
表现出一些公司的自豪感。

10:20.453 --> 10:23.039
Ah, company pride, of course.
啊，当然是公司的自豪感。

10:23.122 --> 10:24.540
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

10:24.623 --> 10:26.042
Yes?
是的？

10:26.125 --> 10:27.376
Have you always had three legs?
你一直都是三足的吗？

10:27.460 --> 10:28.794
Yes.
是的。

10:28.878 --> 10:31.255
Interesting.
有趣的。

10:31.339 --> 10:33.549
Well, what's this about
a splinter that Squidward's been
telling me all about?
嗯，这是关于什么的
章鱼哥曾经的碎片
告诉我一切？

10:35.092 --> 10:36.552
All right, boy, let's see it.
好吧，孩子，让我们看看吧。

10:38.554 --> 10:41.390
Come on, SpongeBob,
it's just a little splinter.
来吧，海绵宝宝，
it's just a little splinter.

10:41.474 --> 10:42.808
I mean, how bad could it...
我的意思是，这能有多糟糕...

10:44.727 --> 10:46.395
Oh, merciful Neptune.
哦，仁慈的海王星。

10:49.440 --> 10:51.108
OK, no problem, no problem.
好的，没问题，没问题。

11:00.576 --> 11:01.118
Problem...
问题...

11:06.916 --> 11:09.043
Whew, for a second there
哇，一会儿

11:09.126 --> 11:12.296
I thought I was gonna
have to pay you
workman's "compersation."
我以为我会
必须付钱给你
工人的“补偿”。

11:12.380 --> 11:14.590
What's workers' compensation?
什么是工人赔偿？

11:14.673 --> 11:17.968
You know, when you get
paid for sitting at home.
你知道，当你得到
支付坐在家里的费用。

11:18.052 --> 11:21.514
You mean I can get paid
while I'm at home?
你的意思是我可以获得报酬
当我在家的时候？

11:21.597 --> 11:23.557
Yeah, what do you think
"compersation" stands for?
是的，你觉得怎么样
“补偿”代表什么？

11:27.269 --> 11:29.021
Uh... Squidward?
呃……章鱼哥？

11:34.402 --> 11:36.862
I get my "compersation" now?
我现在得到“补偿”了吗？

11:36.946 --> 11:39.448
Nope, sorry, Squidward,
your shift ended over
two minutes ago.
不，对不起，章鱼哥，
你的轮班结束了
两分钟前。

12:11.897 --> 12:14.316
Huh, what's that?
哈，那是什么？

12:14.400 --> 12:16.569
Hmm, must be hearing things.
嗯，一定是听到了什么。

12:20.406 --> 12:22.992
Ah, smell that
fresh morning sea.
啊，闻那个味道
清新的早晨海。

12:26.829 --> 12:30.249
Huh, must be
hearing things... Again.
呵呵，一定是
再次听到一些事情。

12:34.503 --> 12:35.963
Whew.
呼。

12:36.046 --> 12:37.590
What is that noise?
那是什么噪音？

12:40.301 --> 12:42.428
I should have guessed.
我早该猜到的。

12:42.511 --> 12:44.346
It's too early for this.
现在说这个还为时过早。

12:46.015 --> 12:47.808
All right, you two.
好吧，你们两个。

12:50.186 --> 12:52.354
What is the meaning of this?
这有什么意义呢？

12:52.438 --> 12:53.814
"What is the meaning of this?"
“这是什么意思？”

12:58.569 --> 13:01.363
We're slide-whistling.
我们吹着口哨滑行。

13:01.447 --> 13:03.908
Don't you mean playing
the slide whistle?
你不是说玩吗
幻灯片哨子？

13:03.991 --> 13:07.453
Squidward, slide-whistling is
more than just simply
tooting on an instrument.
章鱼哥，滑口哨是
不仅仅是简单的
吹奏乐器。

13:07.536 --> 13:08.996
It's a way of life.
这是一种生活方式。

13:09.079 --> 13:11.373
Let's show him, Patrick.
让我们展示给他看，帕特里克。

13:12.625 --> 13:14.251
Squidward: Hey, get out of here.
章鱼哥：嘿，离开这里。

13:14.335 --> 13:15.794
Huh?
啊？

13:17.880 --> 13:19.465
All right, you two morons,
show yourselves.
好吧，你们两个白痴，
展示你自己。

13:21.050 --> 13:23.344
You see, Squidward.
你看，章鱼哥。

13:23.427 --> 13:27.306
Slide-whistling can add
a little zest to the humdrum
of everyday life.
滑哨可以加
给单调带来一点热情
日常生活的。

13:27.389 --> 13:29.183
I don't need zest.
我不需要热情。

13:29.266 --> 13:31.018
I need you out of my lampshade.
我需要你离开我的灯罩。

13:31.101 --> 13:31.560
What?
什么？

13:33.020 --> 13:34.855
Get out of there!
离开那里！

13:40.319 --> 13:42.947
Just get out of there.
离开那里吧。

13:47.243 --> 13:49.370
OK, that's enough,
you've had your fun.
好吧，够了，
你玩得很开心。

13:49.453 --> 13:51.080
True, Squidward, true.
是的，章鱼哥，是的。

13:51.163 --> 13:52.915
We have had our fun.
我们玩得很开心。

13:52.998 --> 13:55.209
But you know what's
twice as much fun?
但你知道什么是
两倍的乐趣？

13:55.292 --> 13:57.002
Twice as many slide whistles.
幻灯片哨声的数量是原来的两倍。

13:57.086 --> 13:59.213
After you, my good man.
在你之后，我的好人。

13:59.296 --> 13:59.964
Thanks, buddy.
谢谢，伙计。

14:04.009 --> 14:04.677
Not the windows again.
又不是窗户了。

14:10.015 --> 14:11.308
Got ya.
明白了。

14:11.392 --> 14:13.352
They're gone, whew.
他们走了，哇。

14:13.435 --> 14:15.437
Now if they would just
stay out of my house
现在如果他们愿意
离我家远点

14:15.521 --> 14:18.607
I might be able to enjoy
a little squid time.
我或许可以享受
一点鱿鱼时间。

14:23.195 --> 14:24.321
Huh?
啊？

15:05.487 --> 15:07.906
I gotta get out of here!
我得离开这里！

15:10.492 --> 15:13.662
Look, Patrick, Squidward's
finally playing along.
看，帕特里克，章鱼哥
终于一起玩了

15:16.457 --> 15:18.250
Go away!
离开！

15:18.334 --> 15:19.627
Can't you idiots take a hint?
你们这些白痴就不能指点一下吗？

16:02.628 --> 16:04.088
I think I lost 'em.
我想我失去了他们。

16:07.216 --> 16:08.801
Huh?
啊？

16:10.886 --> 16:13.055
How would you like it
if someone did this to you?
你想要怎样
如果有人这样对你？

16:16.183 --> 16:17.226
All right.
好的。

16:40.040 --> 16:42.334
Wow, Squidward.
哇，章鱼哥。

16:42.418 --> 16:44.378
You have got quite
an ear for music.
你已经有相当
一只听音乐的耳朵。

16:44.461 --> 16:46.213
Don't you- I do?
你不——我不吗？

16:46.296 --> 16:47.923
Yes, my friend,
you have got "the goods."
是的，我的朋友，
你已经得到了“货物”。

16:48.006 --> 16:50.050
Well, uh, ha.
嗯，呃，哈。

16:50.134 --> 16:51.844
That  is  true.
确实如此。

16:51.927 --> 16:54.012
Come on, play some
more, maestro.
来吧，玩一些
更多，大师。

16:54.096 --> 16:55.639
Me and Patrick want to
dance to your  sweet  tunes.
我和帕特里克想要
随着你甜美的曲调起舞。

16:55.723 --> 16:58.350
Well...
出色地...

16:58.434 --> 17:00.102
If you insist.
如果你坚持的话。

17:00.185 --> 17:02.855
Oh, we insist.
哦，我们坚持。

17:02.938 --> 17:04.940
OK...
好的...

17:17.911 --> 17:19.204
Hello?
你好？

17:20.706 --> 17:22.249
Well, that's unusual.
嗯，这很不寻常。

17:25.586 --> 17:26.962
What is this?
这是什么？

17:29.298 --> 17:30.549
Who's there?
谁在那里？

17:33.302 --> 17:34.636
Who's back here?
谁回来了？

17:39.391 --> 17:41.185
All right, this isn't funny.
好吧，这不好笑。

17:41.268 --> 17:42.978
Come on, jerk, you think
you can mess with me?
来吧，混蛋，你认为
你能惹我吗？

17:52.196 --> 17:53.155
Watch this.
注意这个。

17:59.328 --> 18:00.579
Ah-ha.
啊哈。

18:00.662 --> 18:02.289
Oh!
哦！

18:02.372 --> 18:04.541
Someone, help, baby-assaulter.
来人啊，救命啊，袭击婴儿的人。

18:09.296 --> 18:11.215
Man: Assault your own baby.
男：袭击你自己的孩子。

18:11.298 --> 18:12.549
Where you going,
hey, come back here.
你要去哪里，
嘿，回到这里。

18:14.301 --> 18:15.594
If you say so.
如果你这么说的话。

18:20.140 --> 18:22.768
Patrick, are you thinking
what I'm thinking?
帕特里克，你在想吗
我在想什么？

18:26.355 --> 18:27.815
Probably not.
可能不会。

18:30.567 --> 18:33.028
Woman: Oh, honey, I'm so sorry.
女：哦，亲爱的，我很抱歉。

18:33.111 --> 18:35.948
I promise it'll
never happen again.
我保证会的
永远不会再发生。

18:39.535 --> 18:40.911
Can I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

18:40.994 --> 18:42.287
Liar!
说谎者！

18:42.371 --> 18:43.664
Man: She's not lying.
男：她没有说谎。

18:43.747 --> 18:45.833
She speaks the truth.
她说的是实话。

18:45.916 --> 18:47.960
Someone wicked has disturbed
our peaceful city, Frank.
有人不法分子扰乱
我们和平的城市，弗兰克。

18:48.043 --> 18:49.878
But who would do such a thing?
但谁会做这样的事呢？

18:49.962 --> 18:52.297
Squidward, Squidward Tentacles.
章鱼哥，章鱼哥触手。

18:52.381 --> 18:53.590
He lives on conch Drive.
他住在海螺大道上。

18:53.674 --> 18:54.967
What?
什么？

18:55.050 --> 18:56.635
Yes, we must capture him.
是的，我们必须抓住他。

18:56.718 --> 18:58.804
He must pay for his wrongdoings.
他必须为他的错误行为付出代价。

18:58.887 --> 19:00.764
Oh, he's gonna pay,
he's gonna pay with interest.
哦，他会付钱的，
他会连本带利地付钱。

19:00.848 --> 19:03.058
He's going down.
他要下去了。

19:04.768 --> 19:06.353
Come on, let's get him.
来吧，让我们抓住他。

19:10.732 --> 19:13.610
Patrick, do you think Squidward
is taking this all too far?
帕特里克，你认为章鱼哥
这一切是否太过分了？

19:13.694 --> 19:15.070
He's only a block away.
他距离我们只有一个街区。

19:18.699 --> 19:20.117
what do you make of it, sarge?
你觉得怎么样，中士？

19:20.200 --> 19:22.202
Looks like a full-scale riot.
看来是一场全面的骚乱。

19:22.286 --> 19:23.620
I'm calling for back-Up,
get me the canine unit.
我正在呼叫支援，
给我拿个犬类单位。

19:34.923 --> 19:37.968
Would you like some more?
您还想要更多吗？

19:44.558 --> 19:47.352
Wait, wait, you stupid worms.
等等，等等，你们这些愚蠢的虫子。

19:49.938 --> 19:51.189
I was supposed to
retire this week.
我本来应该
本周退休。

19:53.192 --> 19:55.944
Let's give 'em a grand finale
they'll never forget.
让我们给他们一个盛大的结局
他们永远不会忘记。

20:09.249 --> 20:10.542
Huh, what is that?
哈，那是什么？

20:16.882 --> 20:18.300
I can't work
under these conditions.
我无法工作
在这些条件下。

20:24.932 --> 20:28.769
Now you're in
the driver's seat, Squiddy.
现在你在
驾驶座，鱿鱼。

20:34.358 --> 20:35.943
This is great.
这太棒了。

20:42.157 --> 20:44.242
Well, Plankton finally got
what he deserved.
好吧，浮游生物终于得到了
他应得的。

20:44.326 --> 20:45.494
Whoa...
哇...

20:45.577 --> 20:46.203
Stop.
停止。

20:59.216 --> 21:02.344
Ha, I've never felt
so alive.
哈，我从来没有感受过
如此活着。

21:08.100 --> 21:09.977
I don't want to stop.
我不想停下来。

21:10.060 --> 21:11.937
Um, Squidward?
嗯，章鱼哥？

21:12.020 --> 21:13.939
Are you  sure  you don't
want to stop?
你确定你不
想停下来吗？

21:14.022 --> 21:15.273
What are you
talking about, nitwit?
你是什么
在谈论，白痴？

21:15.357 --> 21:16.483
Up ahead.
就在前面。

21:16.566 --> 21:17.693
What "up ahead"?
什么“前面”？

21:31.957 --> 21:33.750
Man: Justice!
男：正义！

21:44.219 --> 21:47.889
Woman: Dr. Forrest,
dial 118, please, Dr. Forrest.
女：福雷斯特博士，
请拨打 118，福雷斯特博士。

21:47.973 --> 21:50.308
Your friend is very lucky.
你的朋友很幸运。

21:50.392 --> 21:53.478
If it wasn't for
that slide whistle
getting lodged in his throat
如果不是为了
那个幻灯片哨子
卡在喉咙里

21:53.562 --> 21:56.773
the rescue team might have
never found him.
救援队可能有
从来没有找到他。

21:56.857 --> 21:59.151
His yelling, or whistling,
I should say
他的叫喊或者吹口哨
我应该说

21:59.234 --> 22:01.445
under all that rubble
saved his life.
在所有那些瓦砾下
救了他的命。

22:01.528 --> 22:04.573
Doctor, why did you leave
the whistle in his throat?
医生，你为什么要离开？
他喉咙里的口哨声？

22:04.656 --> 22:09.161
Unfortunately, we don't have
the technology to remove it yet.
不幸的是，我们没有
目前还没有技术来去除它。

22:09.244 --> 22:11.830
But on the bright side, he can
still communicate with it.
但从好的方面来看，他可以
还是和它沟通。

22:13.582 --> 22:16.001
Wow, Squidward, listen to you.
哇，章鱼哥，听你说。

22:16.084 --> 22:17.878
You're getting better already.
你已经好起来了。

22:17.961 --> 22:18.920
Here, we'll help.
在这里，我们会提供帮助。

在这里，我们会提供帮助。